# Vendored third-party reference corpora. 2.0 GB / 964 trace files (STRACE WebArena).
# Untracked by policy: reference data, not project source. Never git add -A over these.
HENRI V2/agentic_graph/STRACE-main/Dataset/
HENRI V2/agentic_graph/*/Dataset/

# Worktrees are transient branch scratch space, never committed content
.worktrees/

# mmlu_839_scorecard.json (5.94 MB / 196,616 lines) UNTRACKED 2026-09-11 (approved).
# The body stays on disk and remains in git history. The tracked compact record is
# experiments/verification/mmlu_839_summary.json (headline + all 57 subjects).
# Read the body only through scripts/henri_experiment_digest.py.
experiments/verification/mmlu_839_scorecard.json

# Salvage: 32 duplicate genesis ledger stubs (identical modulo ts/hash)
_archive/worktree_salvage_20260911/**/henri_audit_chain.json

# --- Basal helper archive policy (from main; displaced by the carrier .gitignore
# --- block during the release/main-promotion merge on 2026-09-15). Merged as a
# --- UNION: both policies are live, neither is silently dropped.
# Basal helper scripts archived out of the repo root (2026-09-13).
# These are session-local push tooling, NOT production code, so their
# absence from main is deliberate. They are listed here so a future
# reader knows the absence is a policy and not a lost file.
# The DURABLE copy lives OUTSIDE this host and outside this repo:
#   G:/My Drive/HENRI_Archive/basal_helpers_20260913/
# verified byte-for-byte against a SHA-256 manifest at archive time.
# A fresh clone will not contain that path; do not read its absence as
# data loss.
_archive/basal_helpers_20260913/

# Runtime-regenerated audit-ledger stub. The live hash-linked ledger is
# %LOCALAPPDATA%/hermes/audit/henri_audit_chain.jsonl; this repo-root file
# is a single GENESIS row written at import time and must not be tracked.
HENRI V2/henri_audit_chain.json
